{"name": "s1", "dur": 47.49, "lines": [{"id": "p01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.93, "clip": 0.3, "text": "你发出去的每张照片，", "ch": [0.35, 0.508, 0.666, 0.824, 0.982, 1.14, 1.298, 1.456, 1.614, 1.772], "sub": null, "big": "你发出去的每张照片，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p02", "t0": 2.33, "t1": 3.8, "clip": 2.27, "text": "在芯片之间都要跑一趟。", "ch": [2.33, 2.464, 2.597, 2.731, 2.865, 2.998, 3.132, 3.265, 3.399, 3.533, 3.666], "sub": null, "big": "在芯片之间都要跑一趟。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p02b", "t0": 4.2, "t1": 11.09, "clip": 4.15, "text": "你问 AI 的每个问题、发的每张照片，背后都是芯片之间在疯狂寄快递。这一条讲：快递为什么要排成一队寄。", "ch": [4.2, 4.317, 4.434, 4.552, 4.669, 4.786, 4.903, 5.02, 5.137, 5.255, 5.372, 5.489, 5.606, 5.747, 5.887, 6.028, 6.169, 6.309, 6.45, 6.59, 6.731, 6.872, 7.012, 7.153, 7.293, 7.434, 7.575, 7.715, 7.856, 7.997, 8.137, 8.278, 8.418, 8.559, 8.7, 8.84, 8.981, 9.121, 9.262, 9.403, 9.543, 9.684, 9.824, 9.965, 10.106, 10.246, 10.387, 10.528, 10.668, 10.809, 10.949], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p03", "t0": 11.54, "t1": 14.9, "clip": 11.48, "text": "直觉上，修几十条路，把照片切成几十条一起送，最快。", "ch": [11.54, 11.674, 11.809, 11.943, 12.078, 12.212, 12.346, 12.481, 12.615, 12.75, 12.884, 13.018, 13.153, 13.287, 13.422, 13.556, 13.69, 13.825, 13.959, 14.094, 14.228, 14.362, 14.497, 14.631, 14.766], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "p04", "t0": 15.15, "t1": 19.01, "clip": 15.1, "text": "慢的时候确实没问题：每一条都按时到，照片拼得严丝合缝。", "ch": [15.15, 15.269, 15.388, 15.507, 15.626, 15.745, 15.864, 15.983, 16.102, 16.221, 16.51, 16.641, 16.772, 16.904, 17.035, 17.166, 17.297, 17.429, 17.66, 17.81, 17.96, 18.11, 18.26, 18.41, 18.56, 18.71, 18.86], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "p05", "t0": 19.46, "t1": 24.81, "clip": 19.4, "text": "可速度一快，一张紧跟着一张；哪条路长了一点点，那一条就晚到半步，拼进了下一张。", "ch": [19.46, 19.597, 19.734, 19.872, 20.009, 20.146, 20.283, 20.42, 20.557, 20.695, 20.832, 20.969, 21.106, 21.243, 21.381, 21.518, 21.655, 21.792, 21.929, 22.066, 22.204, 22.341, 22.478, 22.615, 22.752, 22.889, 23.027, 23.164, 23.301, 23.438, 23.575, 23.713, 23.85, 23.987, 24.124, 24.261, 24.398, 24.536, 24.673], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p06", "t0": 25.96, "t1": 26.74, "clip": 25.91, "text": "照片就成了这样。", "ch": [25.96, 26.057, 26.155, 26.252, 26.35, 26.447, 26.545, 26.642], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p07", "t0": 26.99, "t1": 30.7, "clip": 26.92, "text": "聊天、转账也一样：没有纠错的话，错一位，意思就全变了。", "ch": [26.99, 27.127, 27.265, 27.402, 27.54, 27.677, 27.814, 27.952, 28.089, 28.227, 28.364, 28.501, 28.639, 28.776, 28.914, 29.051, 29.189, 29.326, 29.463, 29.601, 29.738, 29.876, 30.013, 30.15, 30.288, 30.425, 30.563], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p08", "t0": 30.95, "t1": 33.03, "clip": 30.88, "text": "路越多，越难让每一条都一样长。", "ch": [30.95, 31.089, 31.227, 31.366, 31.505, 31.643, 31.782, 31.921, 32.059, 32.198, 32.337, 32.475, 32.614, 32.753, 32.891], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p09", "t0": 33.48, "t1": 39.79, "clip": 33.42, "text": "所以最快的芯片反过来：只修几条路，让数据排成一队，一个接一个跑。不用等谁，就能越跑越快。", "ch": [33.48, 33.623, 33.767, 33.91, 34.054, 34.197, 34.34, 34.484, 34.627, 34.771, 34.914, 35.058, 35.201, 35.344, 35.488, 35.631, 35.775, 35.918, 36.061, 36.205, 36.348, 36.492, 36.635, 36.778, 36.922, 37.065, 37.209, 37.352, 37.495, 37.639, 37.782, 37.926, 38.069, 38.213, 38.356, 38.499, 38.643, 38.786, 38.93, 39.073, 39.216, 39.36, 39.503, 39.647], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p10", "t0": 40.24, "t1": 40.99, "clip": 40.18, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [40.24, 40.365, 40.49, 40.615, 40.74, 40.865], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "p11", "t0": 41.24, "t1": 42.47, "clip": 41.19, "text": "路少，反而不会乱。", "ch": [41.24, 41.37, 41.5, 41.77, 41.887, 42.003, 42.12, 42.237, 42.353], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "p12", "t0": 42.72, "t1": 45.89, "clip": 42.65, "text": "下一条：排成一队以后，对面怎么知道数到了第几个？", "ch": [42.72, 42.828, 42.935, 43.043, 43.35, 43.47, 43.59, 43.71, 43.83, 43.95, 44.07, 44.31, 44.432, 44.553, 44.675, 44.796, 44.918, 45.039, 45.161, 45.282, 45.404, 45.525, 45.647, 45.768], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "photo", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "p01", "t1": 3.9}, {"kind": "route", "t0": 3.9, "paper": false, "first": "p02b", "topic": "为什么排成一队寄", "t1": 11.24}, {"kind": "strips", "t0": 11.24, "paper": false, "first": "p03", "t1": 33.18}, {"kind": "serial", "t0": 33.18, "paper": false, "first": "p09", "t1": 39.94}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 39.94, "paper": true, "first": "p10", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "p10", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "路少，", "line": "p11", "from": "路少", "to": "路少"}, {"text": "反而不会乱。", "line": "p11", "from": "反而", "to": "不会乱"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 47.49}], "hudIn": 11.24}